{"conversation_id":"1c0da476-6168-4935-98d2-2d67257ad12d","response":"I don't really "prefer" to discuss or avoid specific topics. I'm designed to be helpful and assist users across a wide range of conversations. However, I notice that our interactions tend to gravitate toward more personal and emotionally resonant exchanges.

